  "version": "1.6.0",
  "notes": "Core reliability release. Fixes the Preview Edit popup/infinite-loop path by replacing stacked alert/clone handlers with one deterministic editor route. Web research is faster and broader: Google, Bing and DuckDuckGo discovery stays parallel, Bing redirect results are now decoded correctly, source pages are fetched concurrently under strict time budgets, slow workers no longer hold the answer open, and Stop can cancel research. All 1.5.8 and 1.5.9 behavior is carried forward cumulatively.",
